{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00311","headline":"奉和麟德殿宴百僚应[制] · 鲍氏君徽","name":"奉和麟德殿宴百僚应[制]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿泽先寰海，功成展武韶。\n戈鋋清外垒，文物盛中朝。\n圣祚山河固，宸章日月昭。\n玉筵鸾鹄集，仙管凤皇调。\n御柳新低绿，宫莺乍啭娇。\n愿将[亿]兆庆，千祀奉神尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍氏君徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}